        "TileImage": "$($repository 2e1a30c5-b1e0-4984-b3f4-67f01f9ebfef).Image",
        "Description": "good evening 47, the ICA has narrowed down the commanders of our enemy. Akira Nakamura the mastermind and Katashi Ito the cheif engineer. They have been operating out of the Gama facility in Hokkaido. You must elimanate Akira and Katashi along with two sleeper agents and Carlton Smith Katashi&apos;s latest expereiment. All but Carlton must be elliminated with accidents to avoid triggering any unkown failsafes. This contract will likely be the end of our enemy. Good hunting 47.",
